 and performance of essential applications and software solutions. The engineer will collaborate with business stakeholders to enhance application design and performance based on user feedback. Key responsibilities include providing technical support, managing software build and development activities like installation and patching, and handling remote troubleshooting. The ideal candidate is an experienced and proactive team player with strong analytical, problem-solving, and communication skills, who is dedicated to quality and customer service.\\n\\n**Responsibilities:**\\n*   Responsible for the development, delivery, and performance assurance of applications and software solutions.\\n*   Collaborate with ASML business stakeholders to incorporate user needs and feedback to improve application design and performance.\\n*   Provide technical support to business areas.\\n*   Support software build and development activities, including installation, patching, system security, data backup, storage management, and VM management.\\n*   Perform remote troubleshooting and serve as a point of contact for problem and incident management.\\n*   Generate ideas for innovation and convey IT possibilities to the business.\\n\\n**Required Skills:**\\n*   Shows initiative, strong analytical skills, and a problem-solving attitude.\\n*   Highly motivated team player with good social skills and a strong service/customer orientation.\\n*   Strong communication skills, both verbal and written.\\n*   Pragmatic, practical, flexible, and committed to quality.\\n*   Ability to plan and set priorities.\\n\\n**Preferred Skills:**\\n*   Not specified\\n\\n**Qualifications:**\\n*   Bachelor's, Master's, or PhD in Computer Science, Mechanical Engineering, Electrical Engineering, or other technical backgrounds.\\n*   4-9 years of relevant work experience.\\n\\n**Benefits:**\\n*   Not specified\\n\\n**Key Technologies/Tools:**\\n*   Python\\n\\nLet me know if you would like to explore any other aspects of your job search\"}],\"role\":\"model\"},\"intermediate_data\":{\"tool_uses\":[{\"id\":\"adk-2fa41585-c37a-445f-8107-6acd663125cf\",\"args\":{\"request\":\"https://www.asml.com/en/careers/find-your-job/senior-it-applications-engineer-j00314603\"},\"name\":\"job_ad_websearch\"}],\"intermediate_responses\":[]},\"creation_timestamp\":0.0},\"expected_invocation\":{\"invocation_id\":\"e-52b5bb67-92ec-4f35-a01d-89f6c359a068\",\"user_content\":{\"parts\":[{\"video_metadata\":null,\"thought\":null,\"inline_data\":null,\"file_data\":null,\"thought_signature\":null,\"code_execution_result\":null,\"executable_code\":null,\"function_call\":null,\"function_response\":null,\"text\":\"https://www.asml.com/en/careers/find-your-job/senior-it-applications-engineer-j00314603\"}],\"role\":\"user\"},\"final_response\":{\"parts\":[{\"video_metadata\":null,\"thought\":null,\"inline_data\":null,\"file_data\":null,\"thought_signature\":null,\"code_execution_result\":null,\"executable_code\":null,\"function_call\":null,\"function_response\":null,\"text\":\"Of course. I will now analyze the job posting from the provided URL.\\n\\nHere is a detailed breakdown of the position:\\n\\n**Job Title:** Senior IT Applications Engineer\\n\\n**Company:** ASML\\n\\n**Location:** Wilton, CT, US\\n\\n**Summary:** This role is focused on supporting and enhancing business applications within the new SAP S/4HANA environment at ASML. The Senior IT Applications Engineer will act as a crucial link between the business stakeholders and the IT department, ensuring that the applications are configured and customized to meet the specific needs of the business. The ideal candidate will be a hands-on technical expert who can analyze business processes, translate requirements into functional and technical specifications, and manage the full lifecycle of the application. This position involves a mix of technical configuration, business analysis, project collaboration, and user support, requiring a proactive and results-driven individual.\\n\\n**Responsibilities:**\\n*   Perform hands-on configuration of SAP S/4HANA to meet business requirements.\\n*   Act as a liaison between the business and IT to ensure a clear understanding of business needs.\\n*   Support the full lifecycle of the product, from design to deployment and support.\\n*   Perform in-depth analysis of business processes and provide solutions.\\n*   Create and maintain system documentation, including functional and technical specifications.\\n*   Train key users and peers on new functionalities.\\n*   Provide 2nd and 3rd line application support for incident and problem resolution.\\n\\n**Required Skills:**\\n*   Strong experience with hands-on configuration of a major ERP system.\\n*   Ability to work with cross-functional teams to influence and build consensus.\\n*   Strong analytical, problem-solving, and conceptual skills.\\n*   Excellent communication and interpersonal skills.\\n*   Ability to work independently and as part of a team.\\n*   A customer-focused and proactive mindset.\\n\\n**Preferred Skills:**\\n*   Experience with SAP FICO, PS, or SD modules is highly desirable.\\n*   Experience with manufacturing or logistics business processes is a plus.\\n\\n**Qualifications:**\\n*   A Bachelor\u2019s degree in IT, Business Administration, or a related field is required.\\n*   A minimum of 5-7 years of experience in a similar role as an applications engineer.\\n*   Experience with a minimum of 2-3 full-cycle implementations of a major ERP system (SAP ECC or S/4HANA preferred).\\n\\n**Benefits:**\\n*   Specific benefits were not detailed in the job posting.\\n\\n**Key Technologies/Tools:**\\n*   SAP S/4HANA\\n*   SAP ECC\\n*   ERP Systems\"}],\"role\":null},\"intermediate_data\":{\"tool_uses\":[],\"intermediate_responses\":[]},\"creation_timestamp\":1753478232.503184},\"eval_metric_results\":[{\"metric_name\":\"tool_trajectory_avg_score\",\"threshold\":1.0,\"judge_model_options\":null,\"score\":0.0,\"e